  <article class="local-notice"><h1>Site information and limitations</h1><p>PIT's isolated toolbox provides manually driven educational calculations and data inspection. Results depend on your inputs, valuation assumptions, fee coverage, dates and the limits stated by each tool. They may be incomplete or stale. They are not live prices, executable quotes, investment or tax advice, or a guarantee of results.</p>
    <h2>No transactions</h2><p>This website does not connect a wallet, submit a trade, bridge, staking or borrowing transaction, or discover your on-chain positions. The surrounding PIT testnet application is a separate product surface and is not part of this toolbox.</p>
    <h2>Publisher details</h2><p data-publication-pending="publisher-and-legal-details"><strong>Before public release:</strong> the publisher must supply its legal name and personal or professional status, a working contact method, the operating jurisdiction, and any address, registration, tax or regulated-activity details required for that model. The publisher must review the final legal and privacy notices. No identity, contact details or company status are claimed here.</p>
